# 绝不提交未遮盖的原件 —— 它们含 GEO 的活凭证。
# 真正的防线是把它们放在仓库之外（../geo-tutorial-source-PRIVATE/），
# 这里只是第二道保险。
screenshots/
*-PRIVATE/
*.pdf

# Credentials. Deliberately broad - this repo's one real risk is leaking a GEO
# password, so over-matching is the correct bias. It will also catch innocent
# filenames (it caught a redacted screenshot called ftp-step2-credentials.png,
# now renamed). If a legitimate file is blocked, rename the file rather than
# loosening the rule.
.geoftp_creds
*credentials*
*.pem
*.key

.DS_Store
